</volume><fpage>838</fpage><lpage>842</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11573086</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002336-Brzovic1"><label>5</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brzovic</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name><name><surname>Rajagopal</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoyt</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>King</surname><given-names>MC</given-names></name><name><surname>Klevit</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Structure of a BRCA1-BARD1 heterodimeric RING-RING complex.</article-title><source>Nat Struct Biol</source><volume>8</volume><fpage>833</fpage><lpage>837</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11573085</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002336-Pickart1"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pickart</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Mechanisms underlying ubiquitination.</article-title><source>Annu Rev Biochem</source><volume>70</volume><fpage>503</fpage><lpage>533</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11395416</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002336-Mallery1"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mallery</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Vandenberg</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hiom</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Activation of the E3 ligase function of the BRCA1/BARD1 complex by polyubiquitin chains.</article-title><source>EMBO J</source><volume>21</volume><fpage>6755</fpage><lpage>6762</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12485996</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002336-Bork1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type